---
title: Recipes
---
<p>Things I cook, in alphabetical order.</p>
{% if collections.recipes.length == 0 %}
<p>No recipes yet. The first one is a text file in the <code>recipes</code> folder; copy <code>templates/recipe.md</code> to start.</p>
{% endif %}
<ul class="card-list">
{% for r in collections.recipes %}
  <li><a href="{{ r.url }}">{{ r.data.title }}</a>{% if r.data.summary %}<span class="summary">{{ r.data.summary }}</span>{% endif %}</li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
